  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Introducing the latest technology from Odessa Separator Inc, OSI UltraMesh, which is designed specifically for wells with severe sand-related failures.",
   "box": {
    "x": 542,
    "y": 204,
    "w": 666,
    "h": 50
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The OSI UltraMesh is constructed using a base pipe, filter media, and protective shroud forming the Multi-Layer Mesh that breaks sand slugs and retains abrasive coarser and finer sand sizes, whilst maintaining high permeability. The OSI UltraMesh has a bypass valve at the top, fluid is ensured in the pump under challenging well conditions. In addition, OSI’s Dual Flow technology allows The OSI UltraMesh to be combined with a Desander if the operator wants.",
   "box": {
    "x": 542,
    "y": 280,
    "w": 666,
    "h": 151
   }
  },
